      'Extreme words (all, only, always, never) → usually do not follow',
      'Ask: "Without this, does the statement make sense?" If no → assumption is implicit',
      'Ask: "Is this definitely true from the statement?" If yes → conclusion follows',
      'Notice / warning → assumes the problem can happen',
